Package: libappstream5
Version: @DEB_APPSTREAM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Distributions/AppStream/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxml2, libyaml-0-2, libxmlb2
Description: Software component metadata library
 AppStream provides a standard for system-wide software component metadata. This
 package contains the libappstream shared library and the appstreamcli tool.
 Pulled in as a mandatory dependency of libadwaita.
